{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 then (∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 5 ∧ shape(v_1, i) < 10) else True
>>
Rule 157 (If ndim ==2 shape[0]>10 and shape [1] must be smaller than shape[0] and greather than 0)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 2 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) > 10 then (shape(v_1, 1) < shape(v_1, 0) ∧ shape(v_1, 1) > 0)
>>
Rule 159 (must be at least three dimensions or all the values must be 0 and 1 and dtype must be int32 or int64)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) ≥ 3 then True else ((max(v_1) = 1) ∧ (min(v_1) = 0) ∧ (dtype_(v_1) = "int32" ∨ dtype_(v_1) = "int64"))
>>
Rule 160 (The range is between -100 and 100.)
{v_1: tensor} |= (min(v_1) ≥ -100) ∧ (max(v_1) ≤ 100)
>>
Rule 161 (if number of dimension is greater than one, each value can be less than a constant. )
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 1 then (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) < 1024) else True
